{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"Nicholas Galitzine (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nicholas_Galitzine\" title=\"Nicholas Galitzine\">Nicholas Galitzine</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i> said he ate around 4,000 calories a day while preparing to play He-Man?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nicholas_Galitzine","retrieved":1785052508652},{"title":"worst disaster since the end of [World War II] (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that a mistake made by a novice truck driver led to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luxembourg_City\" title=\"Luxembourg City\">Luxembourg City</a>'s \"<b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pfaffenthal_explosion\" title=\"Pfaffenthal explosion\">worst disaster since the end of [World War<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">&nbsp;</span>II]</a></b>\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pfaffenthal_explosion","retrieved":1785052508657},{"title":"Sid Brooks (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sid_Brooks\" title=\"Sid Brooks\">Sid Brooks</a></b> served tours of duty in Korea and Vietnam unscathed before being knocked unconscious by an ice ball at a football game?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sid_Brooks","retrieved":1785052508664},{"title":"a star god (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that women in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/North_Chungcheong_Province\" title=\"North Chungcheong Province\">a South Korean province</a> offer <i><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baekseolgi\" title=\"Baekseolgi\">baekseolgi</a></i> and fresh water to <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chilseongsin\" title=\"Chilseongsin\">a star god</a></b> believed to bring prosperity to the family?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chilseongsin","retrieved":1785052508665},{"title":"Tamagotchi Connection: Corner Shop (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that a game journalist called <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tamagotchi_Connection:_Corner_Shop\" title=\"Tamagotchi Connection: Corner Shop\">Tamagotchi Connection: Corner Shop</a></b></i> \"as Japanese as <i><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tempura\" title=\"Tempura\">tempura</a></i>\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tamagotchi_Connection:_Corner_Shop","retrieved":1785052508666},{"title":"Rosemary Kanyuka (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that, two decades after <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rosemary_Kanyuka\" title=\"Rosemary Kanyuka\">Rosemary Kanyuka</a></b> said Malawi's women suffered from \"inadequate laws\" without <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Malawi_Law_Commission\" title=\"Malawi Law Commission\">a law commissioner</a>, she herself was appointed to that role?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rosemary_Kanyuka","retrieved":1785052508668},{"title":"Workers' Party (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Workers'_Party_(Serbia)\" title=\"Workers' Party (Serbia)\">Workers' Party</a></b> supports the accession of Serbia to the European Union despite declaring itself to be <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Euroscepticism\" title=\"Euroscepticism\">Eurosceptic</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Workers'_Party_(Serbia)","retrieved":1785052508672},{"title":"Louis Alexander MacKay (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that one critic called <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Louis_Alexander_MacKay\" title=\"Louis Alexander MacKay\">Louis Alexander MacKay</a></b> the \"most angry and clever satirist\" in Canada?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Louis_Alexander_MacKay","retrieved":1785052508672},{"title":"The Art of the Bawdy Song (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Art_of_the_Bawdy_Song\" title=\"The Art of the Bawdy Song\">The Art of the Bawdy Song</a></b></i> was one of the first classical albums to have a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Parental_Advisory\" title=\"Parental Advisory\">Parental Advisory</a> sticker?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Art_of_the_Bawdy_Song","retrieved":1785052508674},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt8\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwIQ\" data-mw=\"{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;banner&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Banner&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;direction&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;right&quot;},&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Cologne&quot;},&quot;type&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;dotm&quot;},&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;CologneBanner1.jpg&quot;},&quot;quote&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Founded by the Romans, Germany's fourth largest city is known for its enormous cathedral and the Karneval in February.&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r4523569\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" about=\"#mwt9\" data-mw=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Banner/styles.css&quot;}}\">.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox{color:white;background:rgb(16,16,16);background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);border-radius:4px}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h2,.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h3{color:white;border:none;font-family:sans-serif;line-height:1.2em;margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox a{color:white;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .banner-image{position